44:["$","p",null,{"children":["The usual use is to keep small objects out of a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"dedup"}]," store, where the\nper-blob index costs more than the deduplication saves. The other use is a hard\nceiling: point ",["$","code",null,{"children":"upper_store"}]," at ",["$","code",null,{"children":"noop"}]," and blobs above the threshold are\ndiscarded rather than stored."]}]
