48:["$","p",null,{"children":["A store's share is its ",["$","code",null,{"children":"weight"}]," divided by the sum of all weights, so ",["$","code",null,{"children":"SHARD_C"}],"\nabove takes half. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"weight"}]," defaults to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"1"}],", so an unweighted list is an even\nsplit."]}]
